h floor. Panoramic Rooftop deck Views, with a shared BBQ and plenty of seating, garden plots, a childrens playground and some of The Best views of the City-Downtown, Mountains, and English Bay.  Unfurnished option is also Available! Secure bike storage(included) 24 hr Concierge and Dog friendly!  Available Nov.  21st at $2950/mo (id:67604)"},"30282181":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_18.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_19.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_20.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639250810314670000/reb89/highres/0/R3165660_21.jpg"],"remarks":"Exceptional 720 square foot home with 200 square foot patio, located on the quiet side of the building with a south-facing exposure, this unit offers tranquility and bright, airy spaces. Featuring an innovative rolling wall, you can easily transform the layout to function as two bedrooms, a spacious master with a den or simply enjoy one expansive living area. The high 9' ceilings and floor-to-ceiling windows flood the unit with natural light, enhancing its inviting ambiance. Stylish laminate floors flow throughout. Step outside to your private outdoor patio, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. With an unbeatable location just steps from vibrant restaurants, shops, and services, conveniently near the upcoming SkyTrain on Broadway, making your commute a breeze! (id:67604)"},"30324133":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258587189930000/reb89/highres/9/R3169289_11.jpg"],"remarks":"Welcome to this modern 4-year-old, private 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom laneway home in a convenient and well-established Vancouver neighbourhood! Offering the comfort and privacy of a completely separate residence, this newer home features a functional layout with two bedrooms and two full bathrooms, providing a comfortable and independent living space. Enjoy a quiet residential setting while remaining close to transit, shopping, restaurants, parks, schools and everyday amenities, with convenient access to major routes throughout Vancouver. Street parking is available nearby. Water and sewage are included in the monthly rent. Minimum 1-year lease required. No pets and no smoking. A fantastic opportunity to enjoy the privacy and comfort of a newer laneway home! (id:67604)"},"30353797":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264779168170000/reb89/highres/5/R3171515_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.c