6377_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516870000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294518130000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516870000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516870000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516870000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294518200000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516830000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_18.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516870000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_19.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516870000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_20.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294587670000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_21.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294517970000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_22.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516900000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_23.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639309294516830000/reb89/highres/7/R3176377_24.jpg"],"remarks":"Rosario Gardens, conveniently located in the heart of Richmond. This East-facing, 602sf, 1 bedroom condo offers a great city view from the living room. The kitchen features all white appliances and decent cabinet space. The bright living-dining area is functionally designed to maximize usage of space. The full size bedroom has access to the balcony. The 4 pc bathroom has a soaker tub with shower. In-suite laundry is by the entry closet. 5-minutes walking distance to Brighouse Skytrain Station, Richmond Centre, Richmond Public Market, PriceSmart Foods. Within 1km there is Kwantlen Polytechnic University, T&T Supermarket, Lansdowne Centre, London Drugs, Shoppers Drug Mart, Sungiven Foods and more! Rent includes 1 parking and 1 storage locker. (id:67604)"},"30435781":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639283031137270000/reb89/highres/2/R3178002_13.jpg"],"remarks":"Top floor, corner unit, skylight. 3465 Glen Drive puts you in the heart of Kingsway, yet the home stays remarkably quiet on the calm side of the building behind its oversized window facing the North Shore mountains and Sunnyside Park. The brand-new bathroom has heated floors for warm mornings. Ride the Peloton, unwind with streaming services and cable TV, or take your coffee out to the private patio. With a Walk Score of 95, cafes, restaurants and groceries are steps away. Main Street, Commercial Drive and Trout Lake are close by, and the bus stops right outside. Coin laundry is on the same floor (coins provided), plus a dedicated workspace. Fully furnished rental including Peloton bike, cable and streaming services. Pet friendly too! (id:67604)"},"30455365":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb89/highres/9/R3179459_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639288178573930000/reb8